## 4. Technical Architecture

### Stack Production

```
Frontend    : Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript
Styling     : CSS Custom Properties (sudah ada)
Database    : Supabase Postgres
Auth        : Supabase Auth (email + password)
Realtime    : Supabase Realtime
File Upload : Supabase Storage
Email       : Resend — perlu diskusi S15-A2
Deploy      : Netlify (netlify.toml sudah ada)
```

### Folder Structure

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── login/              ← sudah ada
│   ├── dashboard/          ← sudah ada
│   ├── pic/                ← sudah ada
│   ├── admin/              ← sudah ada
│   ├── profile/            ← BARU — perlu S15-A3
│   ├── reset-password/     ← BARU
│   └── ticket/[id]/        ← BARU — perlu S15-H3
├── lib/
│   ├── auth.ts             ← ganti ke Supabase Auth
│   ├── store.ts            ← ganti ke Supabase queries
│   ├── app-rules.ts        ← ganti ke DB
│   ├── user-store.ts       ← ganti ke Supabase users table
│   ├── rule-engine.ts      ← tetap (pure logic)
│   ├── utils.ts            ← tetap
│   └── data.ts             ← tetap (static: teams, apps, dll)
├── hooks/
│   ├── useTickets.ts       ← BARU (Supabase Realtime)
│   └── useSession.ts       ← BARU
└── actions/
    ├── tickets.ts          ← BARU (Server Actions)
    ├── auth.ts             ← BARU
    └── admin.ts            ← BARU
```

---

## 5. Database Schema

> File lengkap: `supabase/schema.sql`

### Tabel Utama

```
profiles          id, email, name, role, dept, team_id, pic_id, is_head
tickets           id, subject, body, from_email, category, app, specific_task,
                  priority, status, assignee_team_id, assigned_to_id,
                  sla_deadline, resolved_at, created_by, csat
comments          id, ticket_id, author_id, body, is_internal
ticket_activity   id, ticket_id, type, who, text, is_internal
notifications     id, ticket_id, team_id, is_read
app_routing_rules id, app_name, pic_id, created_by
kb_articles       id, title, body, category, views               [BARU]
ticket_tags       id, ticket_id, tag, created_by                 [BARU — perlu S15-H4]
audit_log         id, actor_id, action, entity, payload          [BARU — perlu S15-G2]
```

### Row Level Security

| Tabel | User baca | PIC baca | Admin baca |
|-------|-----------|----------|------------|
| `tickets` | milik sendiri | tim sendiri | semua |
| `comments` | publik saja | semua | semua |
| `notifications` | — | tim sendiri | semua |
| `app_routing_rules` | read | read | read + write |
| `audit_log` | — | — | semua |

---

## 6. Email System

### Event & Penerima

| Event | Penerima | Perlu Diskusi? |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Tiket baru masuk | PIC assigned | Tidak |
| Status berubah (Done, Revisi) | User submitter | S15-B3 — event mana saja? |
| Komentar publik baru | User submitter | S15-B3 |
| Welcome akun baru (User) | User baru | S15-A2 — domain pengirim |
| Welcome akun baru (PIC) | PIC baru | S15-A2 |
| Reset password | User yang request | Tidak |
| SLA breach | Head Team + Admin | S15-H1 — kapan & ke siapa |

### Implementasi

- **Production:** Resend (`resend.com`) — free 3.000 email/bulan
- **Template:** React Email (HTML email berbasis komponen React)
- **Fallback prototype:** EmailJS (sudah terkonfigurasi)

---

## 7. Auth Flow

```
Import user oleh Admin
  → Supabase createUser({ email, password: generated })
  → Insert profile
  → Kirim email welcome via Resend
  → User login pertama kali
  → [DISKUSI S15-A1] Apakah forced ubah password?
  → Jika ya: redirect ke /profile?change_password=true

Reset password
  → User klik "Lupa Password" di login
  → Input email → Supabase resetPasswordForEmail
  → User dapat link di email
  → Klik link → /reset-password → input baru → Supabase updateUser

Session
  → Cookie httpOnly via @supabase/ssr
  → middleware.ts refresh session + protect routes
```

---

## 8. Realtime (Supabase)

```
Channel: tickets          → PIC Dashboard + User Portal
Channel: notifications    → Notif bell PIC per team
Channel: tickets-user     → User portal (status tiket sendiri berubah)
```

---

## 9. Urutan Pengerjaan

> Fitur `[DISKUSI]` tidak masuk jadwal sampai ada jawaban dari Seksi 15.

```
Phase 1 — Foundation (semua [READY])
  1. Setup Supabase + jalankan schema.sql
  2. Generate TypeScript types (supabase gen types)
  3. Auth: localStorage → Supabase Auth
  4. Ticket store: localStorage → Supabase queries
  5. Middleware session + route protection
  6. Routing rules: localStorage → tabel app_routing_rules
  7. Realtime sync (ganti storage event listener)
  8. Notifikasi persisten (tabel notifications)
  9. Filter sidebar by status (PIC Dashboard)
 10. Weekly chart, CSAT, SLA compliance dari DB real
 11. Search KB dari Postgres full-text
 12. Reset password flow

Phase 2 — Setelah diskusi S15-A, S15-B selesai
 13. Import user → kirim email real (Resend)
 14. Ubah password first login (jika disepakati forced)
 15. Halaman /profile (sesuai keputusan S15-A3)
 16. File attachment upload (Supabase Storage)
 17. Rating tiket disimpan ke DB
 18. Notifikasi email per event (sesuai S15-B3)

Phase 3 — Setelah diskusi S15-C, S15-D selesai
 19. Menu ⋮ (sesuai keputusan S15-C1)
 20. Re-assign tiket (sesuai S15-C2)
 21. Eskalasi tiket (sesuai S15-C3)
 22. Toolbar format komentar (sesuai S15-C4)
 23. Nav Inventory / KB PIC / Reports tim (sesuai S15-C5–C7)
 24. Template reply (sesuai S15-C8)
 25. Reporting filter + stats real dari DB (sesuai S15-D1–D2)

Phase 4 — Setelah diskusi S15-E, S15-F, S15-G selesai
 26. KB Manager — edit & publish (sesuai S15-E1)
 27. Config — edit SLA, edit kategori (sesuai S15-F1–F2)
 28. Users — tambah & edit PIC (sesuai S15-F3)
 29. Export PDF + Excel (sesuai S15-G1)
 30. Audit log (sesuai S15-G2)

Phase 5 — Setelah diskusi S15-H selesai
 31. SLA breach alert (sesuai S15-H1)
 32. Bulk action tiket (sesuai S15-H2)
 33. Shareable ticket link (sesuai S15-H3)
 34. Tag/label tiket (sesuai S15-H4)
```

